>> title: Hamburger Soup
>> servings: 6
>> author: Ted Lin
>> date: 2019-01-19
>> dish: hamburger soup
>> course: soup
>> keywords: hamburger, comfort
>> summary: Ethan's family hamburger soup, for cold days.

# Soup

:brown @{hamburger|1 lb|80%+ lean}, @{onion|1|large, diced} => _base.
:cook _base with @{carrot|2|diced, or more}, @{potato|2|diced, or more}, @{celery|2 stalks|diced, or more}, @{diced tomatoes|1 can} for 2 min.
:{simmer|15 min} _base with @{chicken stock} or @water, as much as you want soup.
:add @oregano and @{green beans|1 cup|frozen} to _base.
:{simmer|15 min} _base.
:season _base with @salt and @pepper to taste.

>> note: Frozen green beans work much better than fresh, for whatever reason.
